cups12|Knight of Cups|Cups|idealism, invitation, emotional movement|Let an important feeling inspire a thoughtful invitation or creative action. The useful task is to connect heartfelt intention with considerate follow-through.|A compelling story or romantic ideal can outpace evidence, boundaries, or consistent behavior.|Make one sincere offer that you can realistically follow through on.|Do my actions support the feeling I am expressing?
cups13|Queen of Cups|Cups|empathy, awareness, emotional boundaries|Listen closely to emotional experience while remaining grounded in your own needs. Compassion works best when understanding does not require absorbing everything around you.|Caring for others can become emotional overextension or replace a direct request with guessing.|Offer empathy while clearly naming what you can and cannot take on.|How can I care without carrying feelings that are not mine to manage?
